  "explanation": "The question asks for the release date of *Xenoblade Chronicles Definitive Edition*. Two sources (D1S1 and D2S1) directly state that the Definitive Edition was released on May 9, 2012, and May 29, 2020, respectively. These are distinct valid answers referring to two different releases of the same title. The third candidate, '2 August 2023', refers to the release of a *soundtrack album* related to the game, which is an incidental release and not the game itself. Therefore, it is excluded."
